{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，S09把“想有人陪”进一步解释成“孤单到连那些气也肯再受”，比X更替人物下结论，削弱了原本值得保留的心理暧昧。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用加亮词先呈现每段叙事骨架，较小的感受文字和按音乐时点出现的提示又降低了同时阅读的负担，普通观众更容易边听边抓重点。更重要的是，Y把亲近带来的温暖、温暖之后的失落、对离开决定的反复怀疑，以及最后不急着回头而选择继续生活，串成了清楚的心理变化过程。它的音乐提示也更具体，能让人感受到情绪为什么在某个时刻发生变化，而不只是看到一组情绪标签。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "08ab24cb-9f26-4947-b8ce-89f16dc184e7", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T232101263723Z", "elapsed_seconds": 83.125, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T23:22:24.409128+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "cb8b3401c59b3f634e0369390c09edbbb7872a7bb4470ce56fd90d0167281419", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_at